    "directions": [
      "Take the chicken pieces in a bowl, add ginger garlic paste and salt to it. Mix well and keep it aside.",
      "Heat ghee in a kadhai and add onions into it. Fry until it's golden brown in colour.",
      "Add ginger garlic paste to it and mix. Cook until aromatic.",
      "Pour the tomato puree and cook well. Let it release the oil.",
      "In a bowl add yogurt, turmeric powder and red chilli powder. Mix well.",
      "Once the tomato puree is well cooked, pour the yoghurt mixture and stir well.",
      "Add salt and let the yogurt cook on medium low flame.",
      "Drop in the marinated chicken pieces and mix. Cover with lid and cook.",
      "Once the chicken gets half cooked, add garam masala powder, drop in the onion petals, green chillies and mix again. Cover with a lid, cook further until the chicken becomes nice tender and juicy.",
      "Remove the lid and sprinkle kasuri methi on top. Mix it.",
      "Cook for more 5 minutes and turn off the flame.",
      "Garnish with fresh coriander leaves and serve hot."
    ],
